# ==========================
# Grafana
# ==========================
# One-off backup taken during the phase 7 migration: the pre-phase-7 grafana
# container had no volume, so its dashboard lived in the container's writable
# layer and would have been lost on `docker rm`. The dashboard and datasource
# were re-imported into the named volume the compose file now mounts, so this
# directory is a local safety net, not something the project needs.
.grafana-backup/